  "brief": {
    "prose": "Urvara Reach is a wide frontier claim on the terraced floor of Urvara, the great southern basin of Ceres: low benches of dark rock stepping down to an ice-cut plain, the basin's central ridge on the northern horizon, and a Registry pad set in the middle of a survey twice the width of any other on the lane."
  },
