        "theme": {
          "name": "TacSim 2350: the sites",
          "style_guide": "Present tense, no second person, no named NPCs in a room desc. A site is a Registry pad on open ground: a cleared landing square, tie-down rings, a painted pad number, and the body's own ground around it. Nothing is built here but the pad; the horizon is close and the light is hard. Desc length medium (60-120 words); details are one or two sentences, dry, with a fact in them.",
